<title>INDONESIA: Summarecon 1996 net up to 38.50 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Summarecon 1996 net up to 38.50 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			  38.50 vs  35.32</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    116  vs  107</p>
<p>    Revenues			   271.11 vs 249.65</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     134.99 vs 107.82</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  81.87 vs  70.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    60.21 vs  66.32</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		 77.33 vs  55.75</p>
<p>Note: The results were audited. PT Summarecon Agung is a property firm.</p>
</text>
